  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bangladesh - Responsible Global Supply Chains</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ethical Trade Initiative Bangladesh is the local implementing partner: Outcome 1: ETI Bangladesh has increased capacity to progress on its pathway of becoming an independent organisation, part of the Joint Ethical Trading Initiatives; Outcome 2: 12 SHCC/PC/TU functional with increased women representation in the committees; Outcome 3: RMG workers are sensitized to engage on the impacts of climate change on RMG workers; Outcome 4: Companies increasingly integrate learning/adopt recommendations</narrative>
  </description>
